#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:1
msgid "计划"
msgstr "Plan"

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:3
msgid "一、Roadmap"
msgstr "1. Roadmap"

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:5
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;项目的Roadmap：[在这里](https://trello.com/b/Pu3B6ofC)。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Project Roadmap: [here](https://trello.com/b/Pu3B6ofC)."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:8
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;但是计划赶不上变化。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;But plans cannot keep up with changes."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:11
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;《灵数奇缘》是一个由兴趣推动的项目。到目前为止没有人是全职参与的状态，所以伙伴们都是一边打工/读书/考研/考公/生娃/带娃/创业/炒股/接包/找实习/找工作/为人民服务中，一边随机地找空余时间为项目贡献内容，随着参与者可用的时间精力的突发变化，提出具体的工作内容时间计划，版本发布时点，实践证明都没有太大的意义。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;\"Luv Sense Digital\" is a passion-driven project. So far no one has been involved full-time, so our partners contribute to the project during whatever spare time they can find — while working jobs, studying, preparing for exams or civil service, having and raising children, starting businesses, trading stocks, freelancing, seeking internships, job hunting, or serving the public. Given the unpredictable changes in participants' available time and energy, setting specific work schedules, milestones, and release dates has proven to be of little practical significance."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:13
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;所以索性不如更加随性舒适一点。做游戏本身就是我们在玩的一场游戏，想怎么玩就怎么玩，想紧张一点想放松一些全凭心情就可以。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;So we might as well be more relaxed and free-spirited about it. Making a game is itself a game we are playing — play it however we want, whether we feel like pushing hard or taking it easy, it's all up to our mood."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:15
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;但是去掉时间节点的目标还是可以有的。但是项目发展是由社区伙伴决定的，也有可能随机受到政策法规经济形势甚至历史进程的影响，所以项目的目标也可能随时做修改和调整，仅供当下的时点参考啦。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;But we can still have goals without specific deadlines. However, the project's direction is determined by the community, and it may also be randomly affected by policies, regulations, economic conditions, or even the course of history. Therefore, project goals may be modified and adjusted at any time, and should only be taken as a reference for the present moment."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:17
msgid "二、长期规划"
msgstr "2. Long-term Planning"

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:19
msgid "1、制作第一款可以玩的游戏"
msgstr "1. Create the First Playable Game"

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:21
msgid ""
"&emsp;&emsp;使用当前项目资产制作一款体量尽可能小的游戏作品（[Game "
"0](/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/index)），包含三个章节的故事，包括简化设计的剧情、养成、训练系统和战斗系统，验证AI学习训练的玩法。"
msgstr ""
"&emsp;&emsp;Use current project assets to create a game as compact as possible "
"([Game 0](/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/index)), featuring a three-chapter story "
"with simplified storyline, nurturing, training, and combat systems, to validate "
"the AI learning and training gameplay."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:23
msgid "2、继续设计和创作《灵数奇缘》"
msgstr "2. Continue Designing and Creating \"Luv Sense Digital\""

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:25
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;继续丰富和完善《灵数奇缘》的世界观设定，设计世界观下更多的故事，以及设计出更多的人物角色（继续尝试挖掘中国少数民族文化+赛博朋克设定元素）。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;Continue enriching and refining the world-building of \"Luv Sense Digital\", designing more stories within the world, and creating more character designs (continuing to explore elements from Chinese ethnic minority cultures + cyberpunk settings)."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:27
msgid "3、运营《灵数奇缘》社区"
msgstr "3. Operate the \"Luv Sense Digital\" Community"

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:29
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;《灵数奇缘》项目一直是以社区的形式在推进的，有捐赠者，有组织者，有承担管理任务的人，有付出专业技能的合作者，但是没有老板，没有股权控制人，因每一位参与者的个人的经济和生活情况的不同，有不计回报的无偿劳动，也有跟社区进行的有偿形式的合作。项目创作出的资产属于为社区共享的伙伴所共有。但是保留《灵数奇缘》IP只属于社区，不由个人独占版权。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;The \"Luv Sense Digital\" project has always been driven forward as a community. There are donors, organizers, people taking on management roles, and collaborators contributing professional skills — but there are no bosses and no equity holders. Depending on each participant's personal financial and life circumstances, there is both unpaid volunteer work and compensated collaboration with the community. Assets created by the project are collectively owned by the community partners who share them. However, the \"Luv Sense Digital\" IP is retained exclusively by the community and is not subject to individual copyright claims."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:31
msgid "4、建立《灵数奇缘》DAO自治模式"
msgstr "4. Establish a \"Luv Sense Digital\" DAO Governance Model"

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:33
msgid "&emsp;&emsp;《灵数奇缘》社区前期只埋头关注内容创作，现在想建立起一个更加健康的运营合作的模式。一是希望建立更加去中心化的社群合作的组织方式，减少对核心管理者的依赖，并更好地体现社区成员的共同决策；二是希望更好的公开评价和记录成员的贡献；三是希望将成员的劳动贡献转换成可以兑现的价值物（如NFT等），让大家的兴趣和付出能转变对自己更有力的支持。DAO还不是一个已经可以成熟运行的组织模式，但是依托区块链技术，集合社区成员的共识和共同寻求更好的事物的期望，也许我们可以一起探索出一条新的路来。"
msgstr "&emsp;&emsp;In its early days, the \"Luv Sense Digital\" community focused solely on content creation, but now wishes to establish a healthier model for operations and collaboration. First, we hope to build a more decentralized organizational approach to community cooperation, reducing reliance on core managers and better reflecting the joint decision-making of community members. Second, we want to better publicly evaluate and record members' contributions. Third, we aim to convert members' labor contributions into redeemable value (such as NFTs), so that everyone's passion and effort can translate into stronger support for themselves. DAO is not yet a fully mature organizational model, but with blockchain technology, the consensus of community members, and our shared aspiration for something better, perhaps we can explore a new path together."

#: ../../source/summary/plan.md:36 ../../source/summary/plan.md:40
msgid "灵数奇缘社区DAO的构想"
msgstr "Vision for the Luv Sense Digital Community DAO"
